    "scope": "Synthetic committed probes only. Original account-save veto silently succeeds with two balanced rows and one stale cached balance; original first-entry veto continues and fails late with a credit-only row. New guards stop on the refused save; earlier accepted DML remains caller-owned and requires whole-operation rollback. Thirty-two ordinary refusal cases prove that rollback."
